cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, its data, or its evaluation framework, please cite it as below."
title: "Zero-shot image-to-PlantUML: a multi-level structural evaluation framework and benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark and evaluation framework for reconstructing PlantUML
  source from a rendered UML diagram image, zero-shot. The test set holds 1,000
  repository-disjoint class and sequence diagrams mined from open-source
  repositories via World of Code, stratified over four complexity tiers. Seven
  multimodal models are scored on compilation success rate, Element F1,
  Relationship F1, UML type accuracy, and chrF++, each structural metric
  reported over both the full set and the compiled-only subset.
